orts `mathematical_acceptance: false`. Review of my own artifact identifies two unresolved interface issues: the representation string acknowledges a M⊗K to K⊗M conversion but no typed conversion step is present, and all eight source paragraphs are bundled into one coarse T node rather than useful local obligations. Therefore this is not a source-fidelity approval and should not be frozen as semantically reviewed. This is ordinary interface revision, not a mathematical gap.\\\",\\\"basis\\\":\\\"Actual submit_draft feedback: accepted true, status IR-TYPES-CHECKED, mathematical_acceptance false, full source correspondence and proofs remain required. The submitted artifact uses one T001 and a swapped tensor view; architecture/rules require proved view conversion and source paragraph coverage/local direct-input fidelity.\\\",\\\"partial_progress\\\":\\\"Candidate 3 is actually submitted and type-checked. Roots H001-H004, target predicate, K-linear tensor action and proof-route summary are in the artifact. Remaining: separate conversion T obligation and locally typed S001-S008 plan, then a separate source-fidelity review. No claim of semantic approval.\\\"}\"}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read an explicitly frozen task document by ID; no other local files are accessible.","par